          <hcontainer name="amendedAct" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1">
            <heading>Medicare Levy Act 1986</heading>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1">
              <num>1</num>
              <heading>Subsection 3(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><b><i>family tier 1 threshold</i></b>, of a person for a year of income, means the family tier 1 threshold (within the meaning of the <i>Private Health Insurance Act 2007</i>) of the person for the financial year corresponding to the year of income.</p>
                </content>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-2">
              <num>2</num>
              <heading>Subsection 3(1) (definition of singles surcharge threshold)</heading>
