                  <num>3</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>Increase the amount of each percentage mentioned in subsection (2) by 0.25 of a percentage point if the person is a tier 2 earner for the year of income.</p>
                  </content>
                </subsection>
                <subsection eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-8__qstr-1__subsec-4">
                  <num>4</num>
